<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle exports to Mexico, to June 7 - USDA. (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		   1,048	    12,476	 N/A</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	 N/A</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    47	     2,387	 N/A</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females   312	     3,651	 N/A</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
